-- auto raid highway star: the stages the train runner can't read; walks the tunnel until its wall door wakes, steps through it, takes the chase car's wheel and holds it at full throttle, picking the lane the oncoming traffic and the potholes leave open (Vehicles.lua sends the seat's input at PreSimulation, so it is written after the player module's render step)
